&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Tech Holding isn&#39;t just a job, it&#39;s an opportunity to be a part of something bigger. We are a full-service consulting firm that was founded on the premise of delivering predictable outcomes and high-quality solutions to our clients.&amp;nbsp; Our founders and team members have industry experience and have held senior positions in a wide variety of companies – from emerging startups to large Fortune 50 firms – and we have taken our combined experiences and developed a unique approach that is supported by the principles of deep expertise, integrity, transparency, and dependability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a senior Data Architect to design and govern the data layer of a large-scale Ad Tech platform transformation.&lt;br&gt;This person will be responsible for understanding the current-state data landscape, defining the future-state architecture, and designing scalable data models and integration patterns across ad delivery, audience segmentation, campaign reporting, inventory, and billing.&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate has strong experience designing enterprise data foundations, conducting exploratory data analysis, architecting batch and real-time data pipelines, and integrating complex legacy systems with modern cloud-native platforms.&lt;br&gt;Experience designing data models for real-time inventory, order management, logistics, or supply chain systems is required..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable conceptual, logical, and physical data models for ad delivery, audience segmentation, campaign reporting, inventory, and billing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map data relationships, dependencies, and flows across existing systems and ensure critical dependencies are preserved in the future-state architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct exploratory data analysis across raw and existing datasets to develop a comprehensive understanding of the current-state data landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profile existing data sources, inventory and characterize data assets, assess data quality, and identify gaps, inconsistencies, duplication, and integration risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define data ingestion, transformation, and orchestration patterns across batch and real-time data streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data architectures that support high-volume events such as ad impressions, click activity, audience signals, inventory changes, and campaign transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect cloud-native data solutions using AWS services and technologies such as relational databases, graph databases, retrieval-augmented generation, and vector databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define integration patterns between legacy systems and a modern microservices-based platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data interfaces, schemas, contracts, relationships, and system dependencies are clearly defined and documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish data governance standards across lineage, cataloging, data quality, access controls, privacy, security, and lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cloud services, engineering, architecture, product, and business teams across multiple workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data architecture artifacts including entity relationship diagrams, data flow diagrams, schema definitions, data dictionaries, and architecture decision records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in data architecture, enterprise data platforms, data engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing and governing complex enterprise data architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with graph OR vector databases, semantic retrieval, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG,) or agentic AI use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing conceptual, logical, and physical data models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing data models for real-time inventory, order management, logistics, or supply chain systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience conducting exploratory data analysis and profiling complex enterprise data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing batch, streaming, event-driven, and real-time data architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience architecting cloud-native data solutions using AWS services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with relational databases and modern cloud data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of APIs, microservices, data contracts, integration architecture, and interoperability across legacy and modern systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of metadata, lineage, cataloging, governance, data quality, security, and access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to assess a complex current-state environment and translate findings into a practical future-state architecture and implementation roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, documentation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with advertising technology, media, digital advertising, campaign management, or audience data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-volume transactional or event-based data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting data platform modernization or large-scale transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting or client-facing experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with cloud professional services teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract role with a high-impact client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge technologies and fast-paced digital innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to influence data strategy and architecture for a leading brand in the sports/media space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote, USA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1772579303.789099&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
