&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1grg37o&quot; data-start=&quot;1994&quot; data-end=&quot;2213&quot;&gt;Maintain and improve SOPs across ecommerce networks including internal ecommerce channels, private sale operations, fulfillment workflows, customer service processes, fraud and payment workflows, and system operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15efep7&quot; data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2331&quot;&gt;Monitor top-level 3PL and SLA performance and collaborate with warehouse partners to improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;po5ua4&quot; data-start=&quot;2332&quot; data-end=&quot;2453&quot;&gt;Partner with Retail teams to forecast and procure ecommerce packaging needs based on sales volume and campaign planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
