&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9hepd4&quot; data-start=&quot;2635&quot; data-end=&quot;2749&quot;&gt;Coordinate across IT, Logistics, Retail, Marketing, Creative, and Finance teams for ecommerce-impacting projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hfy4de&quot; data-start=&quot;2750&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;Manage Jira boards, issue tracking, sprint documentation, and communication between ecommerce, IT, and third-party vendors&lt;/li&gt;
