&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Tech Holding isn&#39;t just a job, it&#39;s an opportunity to be a part of something bigger. We are a full-service consulting firm that was founded on the premise of delivering predictable outcomes and high-quality solutions to our clients.&amp;nbsp; Our founders and team members have industry experience and have held senior positions in a wide variety of companies – from emerging startups to large Fortune 50 firms – and we have taken our combined experiences and developed a unique approach that is supported by the principles of deep expertise, integrity, transparency, and dependability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are seeking an experienced Technical Project Manager, for a project-based assignment, to drive the successful delivery of complex technology projects through rigorous governance and structured execution. The ideal candidate brings 5-6 years of hands-on project management experience, focused on formal project management methodologies, cross-functional leadership, and establishing clear accountability. You will establish and maintain the delivery framework for projects, ensuring alignment, transparency, and excellence at every stage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand up projects end-to-end, defining clear scope, objectives, success metrics, governance model, and ways of working from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain project governance artifacts (charter, RACI, RAID, decision log, integrated plan) as living tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional teams across business, technology, vendors, and operations, aligning contributors to shared outcomes and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage integrated project plans, including milestones, dependencies, risks, and critical path across workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accountability and ownership, ensuring workstream leads and vendors clearly own delivery not the PM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage risks, issues, and dependencies, escalating early with clear options and recommendations for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate effective governance forums (SteerCo, working sessions, exec reviews) with clear agendas, decisions required, and documented outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise executive reporting, translating delivery status into business impact, risks, decisions needed, and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment to strategy, budget, and roadmap, validating that delivery supports agreed priorities and value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close projects with discipline, including transition to operations, knowledge transfer, post-launch support planning, and lessons learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-6 years of hands-on technical project management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success delivering complex technology projects on time in a consulting or agency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of various tech stacks and the ability to engage meaningfully with engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills – you can clearly articulate ideas to technical and non-technical audiences alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple projects and competing priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Agile/Scrum methodologies and project management tools (Jira, Asana, Monday.com, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a proactive, solutions-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Business, or related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile delivery leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JIRA, Confluence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;KPI and CSF tracking/reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, CSM or other relevant certifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in consulting, digital agency, or fast-moving startup environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1772579303.789099&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
